flowchart TD
  In[Manual entry / worker-authorized CSV / licensed aggregate data]
  Validate[Parse, validate, deduplicate, provenance]
  Quality[Coverage, missingness, target type and source quality audit]
  Store[(Normalized research dataset)]
  Split[Chronological train / validation / test windows]
  Build[Point-in-time feature engineering]
  Base[Naive and statistical baselines]
  Model[Candidate ML models]
  Eval[Rolling-origin evaluation, metrics, calibration, segment errors]
  Registry[Versioned model registry and experiment manifest]
  Serve[Forecast API]
  UI[Dashboard / Demand Map / Opportunity Planner]
  In --> Validate --> Quality --> Store --> Split --> Build
  Build --> Base --> Eval
  Build --> Model --> Eval
  Eval --> Registry --> Serve --> UI
  Quality -. reject or narrow target .-> Validate
